1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:01,630
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,440
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,940
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,360
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,060
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:13,380
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,250
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:16,960
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,580
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,310
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,940
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:27,300
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,740
=The One=

16
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,300
=Episode 12=

17
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:35,660
(Two weeks later)

18
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:52,600
You're up.

19
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:53,880
I made breakfast.

20
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:56,399
What time did you get up?

21
00:00:56,399 --> 00:00:56,920
Six.

22
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,159
Drink some water first.

23
00:00:58,679 --> 00:00:59,240
It's warm.

24
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:15,820
(Two weeks ago)

25
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:25,080
This document

26
00:01:25,646 --> 00:01:26,653
needs your mom's signature.

27
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,280
Your stepdad's contract with Su Ya

28
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:29,900
is invalid.

29
00:01:31,646 --> 00:01:32,980
I'm sorry for what Su Ya did.

30
00:01:33,826 --> 00:01:34,980
My dad spoiled her rotten.

31
00:01:35,313 --> 00:01:35,886
No need to apologize.

32
00:01:36,553 --> 00:01:37,573
What she does isn't on you.

33
00:01:41,786 --> 00:01:42,653
I'll come over tonight.

34
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:47,193
(If...)

35
00:01:48,013 --> 00:01:48,893
(if you do love him too,)

36
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:50,086
(please)

37
00:01:50,706 --> 00:01:51,480
(let him go.)

38
00:01:52,386 --> 00:01:52,986
(Please.)

39
00:02:11,353 --> 00:02:11,953
What's wrong?

40
00:02:13,460 --> 00:02:13,713
Hm?

41
00:02:16,233 --> 00:02:17,780
♪You don't have to make this hard♪

42
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:20,260
♪I'll be the one to walk away♪

43
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,513
I'm off on business tonight.

44
00:02:23,633 --> 00:02:25,360
♪But letting go means♪

45
00:02:26,293 --> 00:02:27,120
Let's end this.

46
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,480
From now on,

47
00:02:31,580 --> 00:02:32,206
don't come looking for me.

48
00:02:33,493 --> 00:02:36,426
♪Erasing you from my memory♪

49
00:02:38,333 --> 00:02:40,693
♪Some love is still there♪

50
00:02:41,073 --> 00:02:42,500
♪But I can't put it into words♪

51
00:02:42,853 --> 00:02:46,473
♪Those who love deeply never change♪

52
00:02:47,013 --> 00:02:48,780
♪It's hard to let go♪

53
00:02:50,906 --> 00:02:51,480
(Why?)

54
00:02:53,210 --> 00:02:54,906
(Because I'm that little boy)

55
00:02:56,806 --> 00:02:58,440
(But I'm trying so hard to grow up.)

56
00:02:58,806 --> 00:03:00,760
♪The more I hurt, the more I hope♪

57
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,340
♪For the love you give me♪

58
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:06,160
♪Our story changed, memories overflow♪

59
00:03:06,450 --> 00:03:09,260
♪How am I supposed to move on?♪

60
00:03:09,786 --> 00:03:11,440
♪I'm still the one left behind♪

61
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,940
♪I never ran straight into love♪

62
00:03:14,166 --> 00:03:17,526
♪I still wasn't the one you chose♪

63
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,120
Hello?

64
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:23,840
I'm back.

65
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:25,800
Where are you?

66
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,159
Come have a drink with me.

67
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,520
Come on, stop drinking.

68
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,280
You've been working nonstop lately.

69
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:38,080
And you ended things with Ice Cream Boy?

70
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,159
Yeah.

71
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,199
Why?

72
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:45,280
Because...

73
00:03:47,266 --> 00:03:48,453
I can only give him two out of ten.

74
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,520
Yining.

75
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:57,680
I wish I were into women.

76
00:03:58,666 --> 00:03:59,753
I'd give you all ten.

77
00:04:00,439 --> 00:04:01,639
Thanks.

78
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:02,639
Come on, no more.

79
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,599
You're really drunk.

80
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,800
What are you looking at?

81
00:04:20,153 --> 00:04:23,500
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

82
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,993
♪Waiting for an answer I'll never get♪

83
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:29,639
I thought we said no guys tonight.

84
00:04:32,366 --> 00:04:33,000
Su Yan.

85
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:36,199
You...

86
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,480
You look...

87
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,873
like someone I know.

88
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:44,600
Su Yan.

89
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,199
But...

90
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,600
he's better looking than you.

91
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,639
And he smells better too.

92
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,759
She's drunk.

93
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:55,720
I'll take her home.

94
00:04:56,673 --> 00:04:59,786
♪But I can't escape the loneliness♪

95
00:05:00,260 --> 00:05:03,620
♪My thoughts of you keep blooming♪

96
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:07,120
♪After you turn away, I can't forget♪

97
00:05:07,346 --> 00:05:10,420
♪I replay it all again in my mind♪

98
00:05:11,166 --> 00:05:13,800
♪Is it hard to forget what I never had?♪

99
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,880
Learn how to kiss yet?

100
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:19,820
=The One=

101
00:05:19,839 --> 00:05:20,879
Your sugar mama's here.

102
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,100
(Su Yan.)

103
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,126
(Tell me.)

104
00:05:29,460 --> 00:05:30,800
(What would make you feel better?)

105
00:05:31,110 --> 00:05:34,510
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

106
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:38,090
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

107
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:41,710
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

108
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:45,920
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

109
00:06:00,650 --> 00:06:03,860
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

110
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:07,430
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

111
00:06:07,430 --> 00:06:10,780
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

112
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:14,440
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

113
00:06:14,490 --> 00:06:18,060
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

114
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:21,700
♪I hum this song alone♪

115
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:25,330
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

116
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:29,200
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

117
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:32,590
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

118
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:36,320
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

119
00:06:36,340 --> 00:06:39,850
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

120
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:44,440
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
